        "cooked": "<p>Today I found some nice fabric at the market. I immediately thought of Sentinels, and what I wanted to do with it...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>![](upload://A78GLh45tsADi28m9Aj7KvKvu3x.jpeg)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>A token bag!</p><p>I had to buy a minimum of 50 centimeters and that was more than enough to make 4 bags. So I made 2 bags in one go. One for a me and one for a friend of mine.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
