        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/e56c9b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-21T10:50:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Apparently, it's rather easy. You can buy something called 'transfer paper'. You print (with your own printer) the image on this special paper that is suitable for printers. Then you simply iron it on any piece of cloth.</p><p>YouTube: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Us7yI6VjdUg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Us7yI6VjdUg</a></p><p>This is tempting...</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
